    "['nhrp entry multicast [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols nhrp multicast dynamic-nhrp', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI command `nhrp entry multicast dynamic`:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols nhrp multicast dynamic-nhrp\\n##\\n\\nThis Juniper command enables dynamic NHRP registration for multicast traffic, which is functionally equivalent to the HUAWEI command. The `dynamic-nhrp` parameter allows spoke routers to dynamically register their NBMA addresses with the hub for multicast traffic forwarding.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols nhrp multicast dynamic-nhrp'}]]": 1,
